  "bodyHash": "d017a671d7d8baaa",
  "content": "\n\n<p>本模组在平原生物群系中添加了一座<strong>劫掠者堡垒</strong>，内部充满了战利品和贵重物资。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>生成位置：</strong><strong>堡垒</strong>会生成在<strong>平原生物群系</strong>中。</li>\n<li><strong>守卫：</strong>堡垒由各种劫掠者把守。</li>\n<li>掠夺者负责守护战利品，你也可以发现隐藏的宝藏。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1136/153/310/172/illager-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"164\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1136/151/310/172/illager-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"164\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1136/157/310/172/illager-cover.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"165\" height=\"165\"></p>\n<p>欢迎在你的整合包中使用本模组。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1136/149/310/172/illager-3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"164\"></p>\n<p>本模组与以下开发者合作制作：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fmrminetex%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrMinetex</a></p>",
